  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">INTERNATIONAL CRIMINAL COURT TRUST FUND FOR VICTIMS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is core funding for the ICC&#x2019;s Trust Fund for Victims to support its work under both its reparations mandate and assistance mandate. The grant contributes to ongoing activities in Central African Republic, Cote d&#x2019;Ivoire, Democratic Republic of the Congo, Georgia, Kenya, Mali and Uganda. As well as psychological and physical assistance, the TF provides material support to improve the economic status of victim survivors through education, economic development, rebuilding of community infrastructure, and creation of employment opportunities.</narrative>
  </description>
